      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shenime]",
      "translation" : "[谢尼梅]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 36,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "There are some soldiers dispatched by Mayor not too long ago.",
      "translation" : "不久前，市长派了一些士兵过来。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I should sure hope that you aren't the disturbance they're looking for, right?",
      "translation" : "我真希望你不是他们要找的麻烦制造者，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 41,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shenime]",
      "translation" : "[谢尼梅]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 42,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Given the tight internal security, you should prepare yourself.",
      "translation" : "这里内部戒备森严，你最好做好准备。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 43,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Wait here for a minute.",
      "translation" : "在这里等一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Shenime]",
      "translation" : "[谢尼梅]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 47,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "It's not an easy task.",
      "translation" : "这可不是件容易的事。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[High-level Laphine's]",
      "translation" : "[高级拉斐内]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Chief of Staff",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Hmm? This room?",
